+/**
+ * Codev customization (spec 250).
+ *
+ * Without this the mapping below rewrote every hierarchy refusal as a generic
+ * invariant error reading "Failed to generate an event identifier" — a message
+ * that is not merely lossy but FALSE, and which was then persisted onto the
+ * command receipt and replayed on every redispatch of the same commandId.
+ *
+ * The six `reason` discriminants exist so a caller can tell a retry ("no such
